                        amount_only - \xd0\xbf\xd1\x80\xd0\xb5\xd0\xb4\xd0\xbc\xd0\xb5\xd1\x82\xd1\x8b \xd0\xb1\xd1\x83\xd0\xb4\xd1\x83\xd1\x82 \xd0\xbf\xd0\xbe\xd0\xba\xd0\xb0\xd0\xb7\xd1\x8b\xd0\xb2\xd0\xb0\xd1\x82\xd1\x8c \xd1\x82\xd0\xbe\xd0\xbb\xd1\x8c\xd0\xba\xd0\xbe \xd0\xbd\xd0\xb5\xd0\xb8\xd0\xb7\xd0\xbc\xd0\xb5\xd0\xbd\xd1\x8f\xd0\xb5\xd0\xbc\xd0\xbe\xd0\xb5 \xd0\xba\xd0\xbe\xd0\xbb\xd0\xb8\xd1\x87\xd0\xb5\xd1\x81\xd1\x82\xd0\xb2\xd0\xbe
